  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:250px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-lightblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Cosmic Energizing</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/dc/250px-TyrantCosmic49iyxwh.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120606193341\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"250px-TyrantCosmic49iyxwh\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/dc/250px-TyrantCosmic49iyxwh.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120606193341\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/dc/250px-TyrantCosmic49iyxwh.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120606193341 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/dc/250px-TyrantCosmic49iyxwh.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120606193341 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"250px-TyrantCosmic49iyxwh\" width=\"250\" height=\"381\" data-image-key=\"250px-TyrantCosmic49iyxwh.jpg\" data-image-name=\"250px-TyrantCosmic49iyxwh.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Tyrant (Marvel Comics) can enhance himself with cosmic energy.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Be enhanced by cosmic energy.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div> \n<p>The power to <b>absorb cosmic energy to improve the bodily functions</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Cosmic Energy Absorption\">Cosmic Energy Absorption</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energized_Body\" title=\"Energized Body\">Energized Body</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCosmic_Energizing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can enhance themselves through absorbing cosmic energy and converting it into bodily energy to perform superhuman feats.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCosmic_Energizing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Matter_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Energy Matter Manipulation\">Bio-Energy Matter Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Cosmic_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Cosmic Manipulation\">Bio-Cosmic Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Cosmic_Transformer\" title=\"Bio-Cosmic Transformer\">Bio-Cosmic Transformer</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bodily_Attribute_Augmentation\" title=\"Bodily Attribute Augmentation\">Bodily Attribute Augmentation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Body/Absolute\" title=\"Peak Human Body/Absolute\">Peak Human Body/Absolute</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Empowerment\" title=\"Cosmic Empowerment\">Cosmic Empowerment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Sustenance\" title=\"Self-Sustenance\">Self-Sustenance</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Cosmic Energy Absorption\">Cosmic Energy Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Conversion\" title=\"Cosmic Conversion\">Cosmic Conversion</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCosmic_Energizing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Cosmic Energy Manipulation\">Cosmic Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Semi-Immortality\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Semi-Immortality\">Semi-Immortality</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCosmic_Energizing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li>May be limited to how much one can absorb.</li>\n<li>May need to keep absorbing energy over periods of time to maintain biological stability.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCosmic_Energizing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Kryptonians (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Daxamites (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Tamaraneans (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Captain Marvel (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Galactus (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Ahmet Abdol/Living Monolith (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Robert Da Costa/Sunspot (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Thaddues Ross/The Red Hulk (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Tyrant (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260801121849\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.067 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 101/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 102/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   52.644      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%   52.644      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:431091-0!sseVary=RegularP